'''Sanguine Art''' is a dark and vampiric-based [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] that is obtainable in the [[Third Sea]].

The style focuses on using 'dark' styled leech-like attacks (similar to [[Ghoul]] and [[Shadow]]), dealing high damage, with plenty of utility and auto-aim.

Sanguine Art's life leech, decently easy-to-hit moves, and very high [[combos|combo]] potential make it one of the best [[fighting styles]] for general use, with its main rivals being [[Godhuman]] and [[Electric Claw|Elettric claw]].   

==Obtainment==
Sanguine Art can be learned from [[Shafi]], who can be found in a base linked by a tunnel near the [[Island Boy]]s, located at the [[Tiki Outpost]]. 

To purchase Sanguine Art from [[Shafi]], the player must:
# Give a {{Leviathan Heart}} [[Leviathan Heart]] to [[Shafi]].
#* This is dropped after defeating the [[Leviathan]] and using a harpoon from the [[Beast Hunter]] ship. The player then has to carry it back to [[Tiki Outpost]] to obtain it in their [[Inventory]]. The player will lose the [[Leviathan Heart|heart]] upon purchase.
#* If the player does not have a [[Leviathan Heart]] in their [[inventory]], [[Shafi]] will reply with  "'''''You lack a cold heart...'''''" during the dialogue.
# Then has to additionally get:
#* {{Demonic Wisp|20}} [[Demonic Wisp]]s
#* {{Vampire Fang|20}} [[Vampire Fang]]s
#* {{Dark Fragment|2}} [[Dark Fragment]]s
# A final prompt will ask the player to pay {{Money|5,000,000}} and {{Fragment|5,000}}. Once complete, the player will obtain Sanguine Art.
