==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Amazing for grinding, [[Raids]] and [[Sea Events]] thanks to its long range and life steal. If the player pairs it with a V4 race, especially [[Angel]] or [[Ghoul]], they can solo a [[Raids|raid]] just by spamming M1, without needing [[Buddha]], as long as their level is high enough.
* High damage.
* All moves can [[Instinct/Break|break Instinct]].
* Good [[combos|combo]] potential.
* All moves hit [[Sea Beasts]].

|'''[TAP] Normal Attack'''
* Faster than most fighting styles.
* No delay on hits.
* More range compared to other [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]].
* Slight knockback to opponents.

|'''[Z] Bloodbane Drain'''
* Good hitbox, and if the user misses, they may still hit the opponent. 
* Will always heal the same amount even if it does less damage.
* Low end-lag.
* Good range in general.
* Can damage Sea Beast while this move being single-target unlike other single-target moves.
* Can ragdoll the user, allowing for improved [[Skull Guitar]] boosting.

|'''[X] Scarlet Tear'''
* Medium range.
* Can fling enemies towards or away if used properly. 

|'''[C] Devourer of Worlds'''
* Auto aims if it misses.
* Does unavoidable damage if it does a direct hit.
* Brings players toward the user upon a direct hit, allowing for high combo potential.
** Great alternative for [[Spikey Trident]] [X] (Flying Trident Pull) and [[Gravity Blade]] [Z] (Dimensional Grasp) .
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Extremely hard and time-consuming to get due to needing to spawn the [[Leviathan]] and needing the [[Beast Hunter]] [[Boats|boat]] in order to obtain the [[Leviathan Heart]], as well as requiring the player to obtain a lot of materials.
* Some moves have short range compared to other [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]].
* Moves are not that good with [[Buddha]] due to its attacks primarily forcing forward.
* Very poor mobility when compared to other [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]].
* High mastery requirements.

|'''[Z] Bloodbane Drain'''
* Single target.
* Stuns the user in place while using the move, allowing enemies to damage the user.
* Hard to hit with [[Buddha]], requiring you to aim from above.
* Easy to [[Instinct]] trick.

|'''[X] Scarlet Tear'''
* Smaller range radius compared to other [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]].
* Strong discarding, which prevents the continuation of some [[combos]].
* Slight endlag, easy to punish if missed.
* May be hard to land if far away.

|'''[C] Devourer of Worlds'''
* Slightly long cooldown.
* High endlag, making the user vulnerable to attacks if missed.
* The dark orb is easily avoided as the orb has delay before the initial explosion, rendering this move easily evadable at longer ranges.
}}
