==Trivia==
* The first part of the name "Sanguine Art" derives from the Latin word ''Sanguis'', meaning blood, and in literary and heraldic usage denotes "blood-red", reflecting the style's aesthetic.
* Sanguine Art is the only [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] to have a life-stealing move. ({{Ability|Z}}) 
** Likewise, the bats can damage large objects (Such as [[Sea Beast]]s), but it does not restore the user's [[health]] or grab. In simple words, the [[Life Leech|life leech]] ability simply doesn't work on them.
*** Additionally, this move features aim assist that enables the user to grab enemies within the attack path directly ahead, provided they are at a close enough distance. This effectively extends the range for grabbing enemies to approximately 1.6 times farther along the straight line in front of the move.
* The {{Ability|C}} move is a multi-target [[Area of Effect|AoE]] move, meaning it can grab multiple targets at the same time if directly used.
** Even if it misses, it can still track multiple enemies.
* Sanguine Art and [[Water Kung Fu]] possess the fastest M1 attack speed among all [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]].
* Sanguine Art has the highest {{Ability|C}} move damage of any [[Fighting Style|fighting style]] in the game.
* The player is not required to have mastery on any other [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] to learn Sanguine Art. Hence, it is possible to learn it even if the user is still using [[Combat]].
* The only [[Enemies|enemies]] that use this [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] are [[Haunted Crew Member]], [[Red Commander]], and the NPCs from [[Ghost]]'s {{Ability|Ghost|V}} move. The Ghost NPCs only use it if the user has Sanguine Art equipped.
* If combining [[Skull Guitar]]'s {{Ability|Skull Guitar|X}}, [[Ghoul Mask]], [[Ghoul]] V4's [[Ghoul#Changes of Stages|Blood Siphon]] (Tier 2) at the [[Nychthemeron|night time]], and using the {{Ability|Z}} move, the player's life-leech can reach ≈47-50%.
* Sanguine Art is the only fighting style without an upgraded (or downgraded) version.
* If the player has a [[Leviathan Heart]] and interacts with [[Shafi]], their [[materials]] (if they have them) will be consumed automatically, even if they didn't wish to.
* There is a glitch where after using {{Ability|C}}, the user will be stuck in the move stance. This can be undone by using the ability again.
* Unlike most other [[Fighting styles|Fighting Styles]] or [[Swords]], Sanguine Art has a unique 'deadzone' when used with the [[Buddha]] transformation. It cannot hit enemies that are standing directly under the user's feet or too close to the character's center. Furthermore, it lacks a 360-degree hitbox, making it unable to hit enemies behind the user, which can make grinding slightly more inconvenient compared to other [[Fighting Styles|fighting styles]].
** Also, Sanguine Art is unique above many fighting styles: it's M1 attacks are being long ranged rather than short, allowing the player to hit enemies from a distance.

